HSztBg","user":{"login":"DimaKiva","id":11325733,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzI1NzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11325733?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva","html_url":"https://github.com/DimaKiva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DimaKiva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T23:34:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T23:34:42Z","body":"> Closing as this is an expected, documented required migration from 4.6 to 4.7: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.7.html#id3\n> \n> Introduced via [#107679](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679)\n> \n> Sorry this has hit you - we reasoned about how many people this is likely to affect, and after some research concluded that it will not be many (as it requires a project using the first interaction layer, and the first interaction layer only, for audio bus overrides - which we deemed unlikely many projects do).\n\nIt would be good if the first layer was enabled by default.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4784450822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]